description=Discord-style AI noise suppression (RNNoise + Wiener post-filter) and a natural deep voice for voice notes, recording, open mic and internet calls, plus the phone's own noise suppression (Qualcomm Fluence, AEC/NS). Keeps the Mi A2 Lite mic boost and L/R swap. Universal: Magisk, KernelSU, APatch.
